<Slide style={{ padding: '60px', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 62 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26282E', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>两条边界主动交底，都是已知且可局部收敛的实现问题</Text>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, width: '100%', background: '#D3DBE5', marginTop: 18 }} />
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 470, marginTop: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 380, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 440, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 170, background: '#F4F4F4', borderLeft: '4px solid #1A3358', padding: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A3358' }}>P0 · 晚进局稳定落后几百 ms</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12 }}>backlog &lt; 8 时开局未置 catchingUp，两端同为 24Hz 同速消费，差距恒定；不是模型缺陷，是时间轴装配缺口</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 170, background: '#F4F4F4', borderLeft: '4px solid #1A3358', padding: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A3358' }}>无服务器权威裁决</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12 }}>服务器不跑规则，不能直接判定命中与移动合法性；这是状态同步相对帧同步的真实优势，不回避</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 100, justifyContent: 'space-around', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 26, background: '#E6EDF5', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#234B80' }}>→</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 26, background: '#E6EDF5', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#234B80' }}>→</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 488, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 170, background: '#E6EDF5', borderLeft: '4px solid #234B80', padding: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#234B80' }}>修法明确，可局部落地</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#26282E', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12 }}>装配时间轴后仅在开局置一次 catchingUp=true；补 backlog 回落稳态护栏；不把阈值 8 降到 4</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 170, background: '#E6EDF5', borderLeft: '4px solid #234B80', padding: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#234B80' }}>当前场景不成立，必要时局部增强</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#26282E', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12 }}>2–16 人好友房、无排位与经济结算；若上竞技，可加服务器复核 hash，不必推翻主链路</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 46, marginTop: 16, background: '#E6EDF5', borderLeft: '4px solid #1A3358', paddingLeft: 20, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A3358' }}>所以：换状态同步不会自动解决延迟、插值与手感，只会换一类新的复杂度。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 20, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666666' }}>依据：game.pack.ts 时间轴装配 / 房间制与产品范围</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666666' }}>11 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
